Package: hd-manager
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Erik Van Hamme <erik.vanhamme@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: python3, openssh-client, hd-base (>= 1.93)
Suggests: hd-dashboard
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: HyprDebian manager of the jobs of the estate
 Makes the jobs of the estate, signs them with the manager key, a
 passphrase-protected Ed25519 key in ~/.ssh, and sends them to the hyprdebian
 dashboard of hd-dashboard, which hands them out to the agents of hd-agent.
 An agent only runs a job that is signed by one of its manager_keys.
 .
 hd-manager key makes the key and prints its public key, hd-manager schedule
 upgrade schedules an upgrade of some systems or of all that run hd-agent,
 and hd-manager jobs lists the jobs and their states. It runs as the user,
 with the settings in the key hd-manager of ~/.config/hyprdebian/config.json.
